 service account",description:"Heading of the section in the dialog shown before connecting a third-party app, recommending which kind of account to connect."},connectWarningTitle:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.connectWarningTitle",defaultMessage:"Connect {appName}",description:'Title of the dialog shown before connecting a third-party app to the agent, for example "Connect Google".'},connectedAccount:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.connectedAccount",defaultMessage:"Connected as {accountLabel}",description:'Note shown under the app name in the Third-party app card, naming the third-party account the connection uses, for example "Connected as alice@corp.com". The account is the one that granted consent on the agent\'s behalf, not necessarily the current user.'},connectedAccountUnavailable:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.connectedAccountUnavailable",defaultMessage:"Connected account information unavailable",description:"Note shown under the app name in the Third-party app card when the app is connected but the third party does not report which account the connection uses."},disconnect:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.disconnect",defaultMessage:"Disconnect",description:"Label for the disconnect button in the Third-party app card when already connected, and for the button that confirms the disconnect. Clicking it revokes the stored access token for the third-party app."},disconnectConfirmationBody:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.disconnectConfirmationBody",defaultMessage:"The agent won't be able to use {toolCount, plural, one {# of its tools} other {# of its tools}} if you disconnect this app.",description:'Body of the dialog that asks the user to confirm disconnecting a third-party app, for example "The agent won\'t be able to use 6 of its tools if you disconnect this app.".'},disconnectConfirmationTitle:{id:"agent-studio-auth.third-party-app-card.disconnectConfirmationTitle",defaultMessage:"Are you sure you w