ery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryTitle",defaultMessage:"Browse available MCP servers",description:"Title of the MCP Discovery Gallery section, inside the tools directory, shown to list available MCP servers"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionCannotAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionCannotAdd",defaultMessage:"Contact your organization admin to add MCP servers.",description:"Description of the MCP Discovery Gallery section, inside the tools directory, shown to users who are not able to add MCP servers (e.g. non-org admin)"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionCanAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionCanAdd",defaultMessage:"Add MCP servers for your organization.",description:"Description of the MCP Discovery Gallery section, inside the tools directory, shown to users who are able to add MCP servers (e.g. org admin)"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAdded:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAdded",defaultMessage:"Added",description:"Label will be shown inside Skills card when the MCP server is already added"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAddButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAddButton",defaultMessage:"Add",description:"Label will be shown inside Skills card when the MCP server is not added, this is a button that will open a link"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestButton",defaultMessage:"Request",description:"Label shown inside an MCP server card for users who cannot add MCP servers (e.g. non-org admin). Clicking it opens a modal to submit a request to their organization admin to enable the MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestedButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestedButton",defaultMessage:"Requested",description:"Label shown inside an MCP server card once the user (who cannot add MCP servers) has already requested this MCP server from their organization admin."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAlreadyRequestedTooltip:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAlreadyRequestedTooltip",defaultMessage:"This MCP server has already been requested",description:"Tooltip shown on the disabled Request button inside an MCP server card when the user has already requested this MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCanAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCanAdd",defaultMessage:"Add a new MCP server",description:"Title of the Custom MCP Server CTA card for users who can add MCP servers, shown in the card directory. The card will act as a way for user to go to admin hub to add a custom MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCannotAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCannotAdd",defaultMessage:"Can't find an MCP server?",description:"Title of the Custom MCP Server CTA card for users who cannot add MCP servers, shown in the card directory. The card will act as a way for user to contact their organization admin to add a custom MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardDescriptionCanAddServer:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardDescriptionCanAddServer",defaultMessage:"If the MCP server you need isn't listed here, add an MCP server.",description:"Description of the Custom MCP Server CTA card, this will always be shown in the card directory. The card will act as a way for user who are able to add MCP servers to go to admin hub to add a custom MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardDescriptionCannotAddServer:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardDescriptionCannotAddServer",defaultMessage:"You can request a missing MCP server from your admin.",description:"Description of the Custom MCP Server CTA card, this will always be shown in the card directo