recommended.codingAgentsHeading":"Softverski agenti","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsSubtitle":"Automatizirajte svoj tijek rada s kodom uz ove napredne AI partnere","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.cursorDescription":"Osmišljen kako bi vas učinio nevjerojatno produktivnima, Cursor je najbolji način za kodiranje uz AI.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.githubCopilotDescription":"Automatski pretvorite Jira probleme u nacrte zahtjeva za povlačenje. Dodijelite GitHub Copilot agenta u oblaku i pratite napredak agenta u stvarnom vremenu.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsHeading":"Naše najbolje preporuke za vas","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsSubtitle":"Na temelju vaše uloge, korištenja, tima i više","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesSubtitle":"Ne možete pronaći ono što tražite? Izmiješaj predložak","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesUpliftHeading":"Predlošci","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesCategory":"Predlošci","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesSubtitle":"Započnite s predloškom agenta","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.averageRating":"Ocjena: {rating}/5","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.install":"Poveži","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.installAgent":"Poveži {agentName} s Marketplacea","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.loadingCodingAgents":"Učitavanje softverskih agenata","studio-browse-kit.coding-agents.installed":"Instalirano"}})},841494(e,a,t){t.r(a),t.d(a,{},{default:{"studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.EmptyState.messages.noCreatedOrStarredAgentsHeading":"Még nincsenek létrehozott vagy csillagozott ügynökök","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.Header.messages.agentsForEveryTeamTitle":"Ügynökök minden csapat számára","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsHeading":"Javasolt ügynökök","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsSubtitle":"A legközelebbi együttműködőid imádják ezeket az ügynököket","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.bearqDescription":"A BearQ elhozza a hozzárendelhető QA-ügynököket a Jira-munkateredbe, hogy autonóm módon összeállítsák és végrehajtsák a regressziós teszteket, felfedjék a problémákat és jelentsék a tanulságokat a csapatod és az aktuálisan használt tesztelési rendszered felé.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.claudeDescription":"A Claude Managed Agents használatával a Jira-ügyeidet pull-kérelmek piszkozataivá alakíthatod át. Hozzárendelhetsz ügyeket az ügynökhöz, és végrehajtja a kódolást egy tesztkörnyezetben, majd pull-kérelmeket indít a GitHub-adattáraidban. A beállításhoz saját kulcsokra lesz szükséged.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsHeading":"Szoftverügynökök","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsSubtitle":"A piacvezető MI-partnerekkel automatizálhatod a kódod munkafolyamatát","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.cursorDescription":"A Cursor az MI-vel történő kódolás legjobb módja, hiszen a kimagasló hatékonyság biztosítására tervezték.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.githubCopilotDescription":"A Jira-ügyeidet automatikusan pull-kérelmek piszkozataivá alakíthatod át. Miután hozzárendelted a GitHub Copilot felhőügynököt, valós időben követheted nyomon az ügynökök előrehaladását.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsHeading":"A fő javaslataink neked","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsSubtitle":"A szereped, felhasználásod, csapatod és egyebek alapján","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesSubtitle":"Nem találod, amit keresel? Remixelj egy sablont!","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesUpliftHeading":"Sablonok","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesCategory":"Sablonok","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesSubtitle":"Kezdés egy ügynöksablonból","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.averageRating":"Értékelés: {rating}/5","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.install":"Csatlakoztatás","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.installAgent":"{agentName} csatlakoztatása a Marketplace-ről","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.loadingCodingAgents":"Szoftverügynökök betöltése folyamatban","studio-browse-kit.coding-agents.installed":"Telepítve"}})},194172(e,a,t){t.r(a),t.d(a,{},{default:{"studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.EmptyState.messages.noCreatedOrStarredAgentsHeading":"Nessun agente creato o aggiunto ai preferiti finora","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.Header.messages.agentsForEveryTeamTitle":"Agenti per ogni team","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsHeading":"Agenti consigliati","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsSubtitle":"I tuoi collaboratori più stretti apprezzeranno questi agenti","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.bearqDescription":"BearQ porta agenti dedicati al controllo di qualità assegnabili nel tuo spazio di lavoro Jira per creare ed eseguire autonomamente test di regressione, individuare problemi e comunicare i risultati al tuo team e al tuo sistema di riferimento per i test.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.claudeDescription":"Trasforma i ticket di Jira in bozze di richieste pull con Claude Managed Agents. Assegna il ticket all'agente, che scrive il codice in un ambiente sandbox e crea richieste pull nei tuoi repository GitHub. Porta tu le chiavi di configurazione.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsHeading":"Agenti software","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsSubtitle":"Automatizza il flusso di lavoro relativo al codice con questi partner di IA all'avanguardia","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.cursorDescription":"Progettato per potenziare al massimo la produttività, Cursor è il modo migliore per programmare con l'IA.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.githubCopilotDescription":"Trasforma automaticamente i ticket di Jira in bozze di richieste pull. Assegna l'agente cloud GitHub Copilot e monitora l'avanzamento dell'agente in tempo reale.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsHeading":"Le nostre raccomandazioni principali per te","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsSubtitle":"In base al tuo ruolo, utilizzo, team e altro ancora","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesSubtitle":"Non trovi quello che stai cercando? Remixa un modello","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesUpliftHeading":"Modelli","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesCategory":"Modelli","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesSubtitle":"Inizia da un modello di agente","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.averageRating":"Valutazione: {rating}/5","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.install":"Connetti","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.installAgent":"Connetti {agentName} da Marketplace","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.loadingCodingAgents":"Caricamento degli agenti software in corso...","studio-browse-kit.coding-agents.installed":"Installata"}})},398684(e,a,t){t.r(a),t.d(a,{},{default:{"studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.EmptyState.messages.noCreatedOrStarredAgentsHeading":"作成済みまたはスター付きのエージェントはまだありません","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.Header.messages.agentsForEveryTeamTitle":"あらゆるチームのためのエージェント","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsHeading":"お勧めのエージェント","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsSubtitle":"身近なコラボレーターは、これらのエージェントを活用しています","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.bearqDescription":"BearQ は、割り当て可能な QA エージェントを Jira ワークスペースに導入します。QA エージェントは、回帰テストを自律的に作成および実行し、課題を発見して、その結果をチームやテストの記録システムに報告します。","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.claudeDescription":"Claude Managed Agents を使用して、Jira 作業項目をプル リクエストの下書きに変換します。エージェントに作業を割り当てると、サンドボックス環境でコードを記述し、GitHub リポジトリでプル リクエストを作成します。自分のキーを使用してセットアップを行います。","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsHeading":"ソフトウェア エージェント","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsSubtitle":"これらの最先端の AI パートナーを活用して、コード ワークフローを自動化しましょう","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.cursorDescription":"圧倒的な生産性を実現するために構築された Cursor は、AI を使用したコーディングに最適です。","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.githubCopilotDescription":"Jira 課題を自動的にプル リクエストの下書きに変換します。GitHub Copilot クラウド エージェントを割り当て、エージェントの進捗をリアルタイムで追跡します。","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsHeading":"あなたに特にお勧めの推奨事項","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsSubtitle":"ロール、利用状況、チームなどに基づいています","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesSubtitle":"お探しのものが見つからない場合は、テンプレートをリミックスしてください","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesUpliftHeading":"テンプレート","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesCategory":"テンプレート","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesSubtitle":"エージェント テンプレートから始めます","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.averageRating":"評価: {rating}/5","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.install":"接続","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.installAgent":"Marketplace から {agentName} を接続","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.loadingCodingAgents":"ソフトウェア エージェントを読み込み中","studio-browse-kit.coding-agents.installed":"インストール済み"}})},610347(e,a,t){t.r(a),t.d(a,{},{default:{"studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.EmptyState.messages.noCreatedOrStarredAgentsHeading":"아직 생성되거나 별표 표시된 에이전트 없음","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.Header.messages.agentsForEveryTeamTitle":"모든 팀을 위한 에이전트","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsHeading":"추천 에이전트","studio-agent-browse.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.jiraRecommendationsSubtitle":"가장 가까운 공동 작업자들이 즐겨 사용하는 에이전트입니다","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.bearqDescription":"BearQ는 할당 가능한 QA 에이전트를 Jira 작업 영역에 도입하여, 회귀 테스트를 자율적으로 작성 및 실행하고, 문제를 발견하며, 발견 결과를 팀과 테스트 기록 시스템에 보고합니다.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.claudeDescription":"Claude Managed Agents를 사용하여 Jira 업무 항목을 초안 풀리퀘스트로 변환하세요. 에이전트에게 업무를 할당하면 에이전트가 샌드박스 환경에서 코드를 작성하고 GitHub 리포지토리에서 풀리퀘스트를 생성합니다. 설정에 사용자 자신의 키를 가져오세요.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsHeading":"소프트웨어 에이전트","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.codingAgentsSubtitle":"최첨단 AI 파트너와 함께 코드 워크플로를 자동화하세요.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.cursorDescription":"사용자의 생산성을 눈에 띄게 높여주도록 설계된 Cursor는 최고의 AI 코딩 도구입니다.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.githubCopilotDescription":"Jira 이슈를 자동으로 초안 풀리퀘스트로 변환하세요. GitHub Copilot 클라우드 에이전트를 할당하고 실시간으로 에이전트 진행률을 추적할 수 있습니다.","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsHeading":"주요 추천 항목","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.recommendationsSubtitle":"역할, 사용량, 팀 등을 기반으로 한 추천","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesSubtitle":"원하는 항목을 찾을 수 없습니까? 템플릿을 리믹스하세요","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.recommended.templatesUpliftHeading":"템플릿","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesCategory":"템플릿","studio-browse-kit.browse-agent.entrypoints.templates.templatesSubtitle":"에이전트 템플릿에서 시작하세요","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.averageRating":"점수: {rating}/5점","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.install":"연결","studio-browse-kit.coding-agent-list.installAgent"